sequenceDiagram
 participant I as Incident
 participant D as Data
 participant T as Traffic
 participant X as Контроллер
 participant C as Capacity
 I->>T: FREEZE
 T->>X: fence A и checkpoint
 X-->>T: A fenced, checkpoint=100
 I->>D: VERIFY checkpoint=100
 D-->>I: B applied=90, ещё не готов
 I->>I: deadline, BLOCKED
 I->>T: RESUME для abort generation
 T->>X: CAS abort if not promoted
 alt Контроллер подтвердил abort
 X-->>T: A writer, новое epoch, generation closed
 T-->>I: SUCCEEDED
 I->>C: RELEASE
 C-->>I: RELEASED
 I->>I: ABORTED
 else Контроллер недоступен
 T-->>I: UNKNOWN
 I->>I: BLOCKED, резерв PINNED, дежурному сигнал
 end
